WEBVTT

00:02.730 --> 00:04.120
Yay!

00:04.120 --> 00:05.360
Aren't they pretty?

00:05.360 --> 00:07.400
I'm so glad we bought these!

00:07.400 --> 00:09.650
Yeah! This rocks!

00:09.650 --> 00:11.820
Big fireworks are great,

00:11.820 --> 00:13.650
but handheld ones are nice, too.

00:18.640 --> 00:20.560
Isn't it pretty, Grandma?

00:20.560 --> 00:22.660
Yes, it sure is.

00:23.480 --> 00:27.560
But the moment that sparkler ends, 
summer does, too.

00:27.560 --> 00:28.790
What?!

00:33.600 --> 00:35.510
Come on, Ami-chan!

00:35.980 --> 00:38.320
Double poop!

00:38.320 --> 00:40.560
Jeez, you're wasting the fireworks!

00:39.190 --> 00:45.420
Poop! Poop! Poop! Poop! Poop!

00:40.560 --> 00:43.050
And what are you finding 
so funny, Ouka-chan?!

00:43.050 --> 00:44.420
I mean...

01:03.080 --> 01:05.660
<b></b>The Café Terrace and Its Goddesses

02:17.650 --> 02:20.990
<b>Episode 11: "Fireworks of Love"</b>

02:17.670 --> 02:20.990
<b>Episode 11: "Fireworks of Love"</b>

